          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“All the men of your nation are to come to worship the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " three times a year at the one place of worship: at Passover, Harvest Festival, and the Festival of Shelters. Each man is to bring a gift ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as he is able, in proportion to the blessings that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God has given him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
